1
00:00:04,490 --> 00:00:08,480
I've had the trail on my bucket list
for about 10 years.

2
00:00:09,130 --> 00:00:12,600
...and wanting to do it, because
I understand there's a lot of—

3
00:00:13,130 --> 00:00:18,950
a lot of emotion that goes into
a 100-kilometer hike over five days,

4
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:23,040
and a lot of sense of being...

5
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:26,600
in bonding with people that are
40 years younger than you,

6
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:30,310
and seeing people from all over the world.

7
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:37,400
Having somebody Sherpa your belongings
from town to town,

8
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:41,000
so you can really focus on the hike.
The only way to go.

9
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:44,600
Makes it a really great trip in a lot of ways,

10
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:47,390
because for one, I'm not carrying it all on my back.

11
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:51,200
And two, there's nothing better than laying down
in a nice clean bed and a shower

12
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:52,550
after a long day of hiking.

13
00:00:53,030 --> 00:00:56,400
I won't be sleeping in a tent or at some hostel,

14
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:59,140
so I'm glad we're doing it this way.

15
00:01:00,130 --> 00:01:03,600
We started our planning about eight months ago.

16
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:07,800
We have been very happy with
the level of communication,

17
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:12,700
the level of efforts, the way
they've kind of packaged together,

18
00:01:13,220 --> 00:01:16,640
informed us about the package,
told us what to prepare

19
00:01:17,290 --> 00:01:23,400
to get over here, making it
an outstanding experience.

20
00:01:24,100 --> 00:01:27,810
Effortless outside of the hike.

21
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:32,900
Accommodation was great, was excellent.

22
00:01:33,350 --> 00:01:36,640
Our bags arrived in the hotels.

23
00:01:37,160 --> 00:01:40,800
I would definitely recommend Santiago Ways.

24
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:44,390
They were incredibly helpful and
fantastic organising our trip.

25
00:01:47,690 --> 00:01:51,650
It is special because of
the feelings it gives you,

26
00:01:52,040 --> 00:01:55,200
the magic that is around it,

27
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:58,500
and the people that you meet.

28
00:01:59,170 --> 00:02:01,730
Buen Camino!
